                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7e410c3b-4488-33c0-82a4-46d0de5b8362",
                        "entry_id": "f337163e-4825-3847-a68e-6b3b92895f52",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person's head, particularly if misshapen or blocky."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cdcac906-78d7-4583-961b-8a7b1b6adf9b",
                                "sense_id": "7e410c3b-4488-33c0-82a4-46d0de5b8362",
                                "text": "[She...] bathed his jobbernowl thrice in the fountain; then threw a handful of meal on his phiz …"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea0b0ee0-5387-48f2-9605-1475feea38c9",
                                "sense_id": "7e410c3b-4488-33c0-82a4-46d0de5b8362",
                                "text": "His toggery was that of a member of the prize ring – what we now call a “belcher” bound his throat – a spotted fogle bandaged his jobbernowl, and shaded his right peeper, while a white beaver crowned the occiput of the Magus."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ff6968b1-e895-4c23-a9ae-6b30adfdbc01",
                                "sense_id": "7e410c3b-4488-33c0-82a4-46d0de5b8362",
                                "text": "He stood on the backs of his brace of hacks, in equitation foul; / And either donkey wore what seemed a human jobbernowl."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c647f0f-ad4b-42f6-88ce-d96024b2222c",
                                "sense_id": "7e410c3b-4488-33c0-82a4-46d0de5b8362",
                                "text": "Trenholme groaned softly in the background, eliciting a sharp command from his brother to “shut his jobbernowl.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2781261d-1106-3ef2-baa8-cb973618b45d",
                        "entry_id": "f337163e-4825-3847-a68e-6b3b92895f52",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A stupid person; a blockhead"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1bbfc2df-6f82-4e2d-abd0-945497d64b54",
                                "sense_id": "2781261d-1106-3ef2-baa8-cb973618b45d",
                                "text": "“And a noodle and a jolt-head; you’re a jobbernowl and a doodle, a maundering mooncalf and a block-headed numps, a gaby and a loon; you’re a Hatter!” I shrieked the last epithet."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "11d9ccf3-f11a-4404-9d9e-c332a38bf0e2",
                                "sense_id": "2781261d-1106-3ef2-baa8-cb973618b45d",
                                "text": "That he pays not the least regard to the requirements of convention marks him out as either a superior soul or a rightdown jobbernowl."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fee34056-180a-44ba-b3ee-9de8376b0da7",
                                "sense_id": "2781261d-1106-3ef2-baa8-cb973618b45d",
                                "text": "STELLA: [...] You’re a – a jobbernowl! / JOHN (arrested): A what? / STELLA (reluctantly): Jobbernowl."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a7c70617-ca19-4708-8597-5cbcb539f6c8",
                                "sense_id": "2781261d-1106-3ef2-baa8-cb973618b45d",
                                "text": "When I discovered I could grow it here — I like to say any jobbernowl can — I was as pleased as a dog with two tails."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
